# Pastas

```
src/domain/entities|ports|errors
src/application/use-cases/{cofre,treinar-com-sql,consultar,skills}.ts
src/infrastructure/{http,mcp,plug-server,persistence,crypto,logging}
src/composition/compose.ts
src/config/env.ts
src/main.ts
tests/{unit,integration,live,helpers}
drizzle/0008_cofre_grafo.sql
```

Novo caso de uso → `use-cases/` + `register-tools.ts` + `compose.ts` + teste + `docs/mcp/tools.md` + `CHANGELOG.md` (Unreleased).

Novo port → `domain/ports`. Adapter só em `infrastructure`. Sem OAuth, sem seed Fonte, sem embedding obrigatório.
